== Chaos Forces ==
A group of people (most likely rogue personnel) that attack the facility in order to destroy it and obtain the classified information (data). You can join this team if you have either the first or the second CF Pack (or both), you can find those gamepasses in the menu shop or on the game's page.
== Scientists ==
Personnel that collect and experiment on crystals, making different types and purifying them so that they can be submitted for ECFR fuel processing.
== Maintenance ==
This team ensures a proper structural integrity of the facility, by fixing the walls, scanners, coolant pumps and by refuelling the ECFR lasers in case they lack fuel. This team is also very important in case of a FFD event due to their facility access. 
== Security ==
A group of highly trained operatives that work specifically for the High Science as a private security force. In order to join this team, you need to join the HSPS server (you can find it below, in the "Factions Servers" section) and pass the Recruitment Academy. You can find more information regarding this on the server itself. '''Security personnel can enter the Security-only areas.'''
